    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  Those Reunion members skulking around... are they our targets?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "Those Reunion members skulking around... are they our targets?"
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  By the looks of things, they don't know that we've completely surrounded them yet.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "By the looks of things, they don't know that we've completely surrounded them yet."
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  They seem to be building something around the entire block.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "They seem to be building something around the entire block."
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  If I'm not mistaken, this is one of the central hubs that connects Reunion's various bases.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "If I'm not mistaken, this is one of the central hubs that connects Reunion's various bases."
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  If we destroy the communication facility here, we can deliver a crippling blow to their forces in this area.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "If we destroy the communication facility here, we can deliver a crippling blow to their forces in this area."
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  That would put us one step closer to recapturing the L.G.D. Headquarters.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "That would put us one step closer to recapturing the L.G.D. Headquarters."
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  Your call.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "Your call."
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  Also, I can't stop thinking about the details of the intel report.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Also, I can't stop thinking about the details of the intel report."
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  You mean, that part about Reunion's objective not just being the construction of a forward base?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "You mean, that part about Reunion's objective not just being the construction of a forward base?"
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  That's right.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "That's right."
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  'Enemies are secretly looking for an extremely high-value target. It is necessary to determine their actions first.'",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "'Enemies are secretly looking for an extremely high-value target. It is necessary to determine their actions first.'"
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  What are they doing in the wealthy districts? What kind of high-value target are they trying to find there?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "What are they doing in the wealthy districts? What kind of high-value target are they trying to find there?"
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  It seems a bit fishy to me as well. According to our previous plans, all the buildings here should already have been evacuated.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "It seems a bit fishy to me as well. According to our previous plans, all the buildings here should already have been evacuated."
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  If Reunion is planning to kidnap one of the moguls, they probably won't find them here.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "If Reunion is planning to kidnap one of the moguls, they probably won't find them here."
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  When are we going to make our move? Scouting doesn't seem to be Reunion's strong suit, so we can carry out our raid at any time.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "When are we going to make our move? Scouting doesn't seem to be Reunion's strong suit, so we can carry out our raid at any time."
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  They're probably used to always being the hunters, not the prey.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "They're probably used to always being the hunters, not the prey."
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  Now that it's their turn to be the prey, they'll be hunted down in no time.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "Now that it's their turn to be the prey, they'll be hunted down in no time."
    },
    {
        "id": 62,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  Let's continue observing them carefully for now. Our priority is to find out what their objectives are, not to engage them.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "Let's continue observing them carefully for now. Our priority is to find out what their objectives are, not to engage them."
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 64,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  It's easy enough to go in and destroy them, but it'll take patience to find out what they're after.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "It's easy enough to go in and destroy them, but it'll take patience to find out what they're after."
    },
    {
        "id": 65,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 66,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  Understood.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "Understood."
    },
